<section class="section" style="padding-top:16px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 3 September 2026</p>

      <p>This Cookie Policy explains how DivineLeads uses cookies and similar technologies on the Power Tools for Coaches websites and Services.</p>

      <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the site function, remember your preferences, and understand how it is used.</p>

      <h2>2. Types we use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Strictly necessary</b> — required for core functions such as signing in, security, and remembering your session. These cannot be switched off.</li>
        <li><b>Preference</b> — remember choices such as language or display settings.</li>
        <li><b>Analytics</b> — help us understand usage so we can improve the Services. These may be set by us or trusted analytics providers.</li>
        <li><b>Marketing</b> — where used, these measure and improve advertising, including ads that bring you to this site. They are set only where permitted.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Third-party cookies</h2>
      <p>Some cookies are set by third parties we use for analytics, advertising, embedded media, or payments. Their use of cookies is governed by their own policies.</p>

      <h2>4. Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings, and where we present a cookie banner you can adjust non-essential categories. Blocking some cookies may affect how the Services work.</p>

      <h2>5. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy as our use of cookies evolves. Please check this page periodically.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:<%= contact.email %>?subject=Cookie%20Policy%20%E2%80%94%20question"><%= contact.email %></a> or WhatsApp <a href="<%= contact.waLink %>"><%= contact.wa %></a>. See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

